  "docTitle": "Stock Price Alerts - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design a stock price alert system, Uber's most repeated SDE-2 HLD in 2025-26: a per-second exchange feed, 5%-from-close, delta and rolling-window alerts, in-memory threshold books per symbol instead of a DB hit per tick, fire-once dedup, expiry, recovery and fan-out.",
  "hero": {
    "tag": "header",
    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Uber</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Stock Price Alerts (Uber's Favourite)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">A broker feed sends every symbol's price every second. Millions of users want \"tell me when TSLA moves 5% from yesterday's close\" or \"tell me if INFY jumps 3% within an hour\". Design the system that checks every rule on every tick without touching a database, fires each alert exactly once, and survives a worker crash at market open - the HLD Uber asked in at least seven SDE-2 loops in 2025-26.</p>\n      "
  },
